<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>A-CODEAI | B2B Compression Scoped Pilot</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Scoped B2B token compression pilot with fixed evaluation gates, lane-separated metrics, and waitlist-first onboarding while SEND_GATE=HOLD." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://a-codeai.com/pilot/" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://a-codeai.com/pilot/" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ko" href="https://a-codeai.com/ko/pilot/" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://a-codeai.com/pilot/" />
  <meta property="og:locale" content="en_US" />
  <meta property="og:locale:alternate" content="ko_KR" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #070f22;
      --bg-soft: #0f1c3a;
      --panel: #132448;
      --text: #edf3ff;
      --muted: #a8badf;
      --line: #2a3f6e;
      --line-strong: #3a548f;
      --brand: #86abff;
      --brand-ink: #0b1738;
      --ok: #86f4cc;
      --warn: #ffd889;
      --card-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(6, 13, 28, 0.35);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", "Noto Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: radial-gradient(1100px 500px at 85% -10%, #173267 0%, transparent 62%), linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg), #0b1734 56%, #0e1e42);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
    .skip-link {
      position: absolute;
      left: -9999px;
      top: auto;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .skip-link:focus-visible {
      left: 12px;
      top: 12px;
      z-index: 50;
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--brand);
      color: var(--brand-ink);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .container { width: min(1080px, 92vw); margin: 0 auto; }
    .topbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(7, 15, 34, 0.84);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }
    .topbar-inner {
      min-height: 58px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .brand { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
    .lang { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .nav-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; align-items: center; }
    .hero { padding: 72px 0 46px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .badge-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .badge {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(19, 36, 72, 0.55);
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 4.8vw, 58px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .subtitle {
      margin: 0 0 26px;
      max-width: 780px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--brand); color: var(--brand-ink); }
    .btn-ghost { border-color: var(--line); background: rgba(19, 36, 72, 0.42); }
    .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--line-strong); text-decoration: none; }
    section { padding: 42px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: rgba(19, 36, 72, 0.62);
      box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
    }
    .label { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
    .kpi { margin: 0; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; }
    .small { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
    .mono { font-family: Consolas, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #dae6ff; margin: 0; }
    .notice {
      border: 1px dashed var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(16, 28, 58, 0.36);
    }
    .pill { display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 8px; margin-right: 6px; }
    .pill-ok { color: #0f2a1c; background: var(--ok); }
    .pill-warn { color: #2b2006; background: var(--warn); }
    footer { padding: 28px 0 38px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .ecosystem-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .ecosystem-item {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(16, 28, 58, 0.36);
      padding: 14px;
      box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
    }
    .ecosystem-item a {
      color: #d5e3ff;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .ecosystem-item p {
      margin: 6px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .card,
      .ecosystem-item {
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
      }
      .card:hover,
      .ecosystem-item:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        border-color: var(--line-strong);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>
  <nav class="topbar" aria-label="Top navigation">
    <div class="container topbar-inner">
      <div class="brand">A-CODEAI</div>
      <div class="nav-row">
        <div><a href="/">Home</a> · <strong>Pilot</strong> · <a href="/benchmark">Benchmark</a></div>
        <div class="lang">Language: <strong>EN</strong> | <a href="/ko/pilot">KO</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="badge-row">
        <span class="badge">B2B compression API</span>
        <span class="badge">Fact-Lock evaluation</span>
        <span class="badge">Waitlist-first · SEND_GATE HOLD</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Scoped compression pilot<br />with fixed evaluation gates.</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Evaluate token compression on scoped, masked corpora with lane-separated reporting and reproducible evidence.
        Pilot onboarding is waitlist-first while SEND_GATE remains HOLD; pricing below is reference-only until counsel and customer measurement gates clear.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://app.jema-ai.com/enterprise/apply">Apply for controlled beta</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:contact@a-codeai.com?subject=%5BCompany%5D%20compression%20open%20bench%20validation%20pack">Request validation pack</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/benchmark">Benchmark policy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main-content">
    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Pilot evaluation model</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card"><p class="label">KPI fixed</p><p class="small">Compression pass-rate, saving proxy, and jaccard floors are fixed at kickoff per corpus profile.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Lane separated</p><p class="small">Track A active, contributor open-bench, and customer PoC metrics are never merged into one headline.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Safety fallback</p><p class="small">HOLD/track_a_primary when readiness or health checks fail during the pilot window.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>90-day evaluation cadence</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Week 1</p><p class="small">Corpus scope, compression profile, pass floors, and rollback policy alignment.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Weeks 2-10</p><p class="small">Weekly KPI report, drift log, and fallback events on masked evaluation sets.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Weeks 11-12</p><p class="small">Joint audit and renew/expand/stop decision with wins and misses together.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Reference commercial terms (draft)</h2>
        <p class="small" style="margin-bottom:14px">Internal reference figures only while SEND_GATE=HOLD. Final terms are scoped per waitlist-approved pilot.</p>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Monthly platform (ref.)</p><p class="kpi">KRW 4,900,000</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Per eval batch (ref.)</p><p class="kpi">KRW 250,000</p><p class="small">Per batch, capped at KRW 2,000,000/month</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Minimum term</p><p class="kpi">90 days</p><p class="small">Minimum contract value KRW 14,700,000 (reference)</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Open bench to pilot path</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Open bench</p><p class="small">Reproduce public commands, verify /health and API routes, review lane-separated benchmark policy.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Waitlist review</p><p class="small">Join controlled beta waitlist after internal acceptance of scope, monitoring, and guardrails.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Scoped pilot</p><p class="small">Validation pack review → scoped 90-day compression evaluation on masked corpora.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Decision checklist</h2>
        <div class="notice"><span class="pill pill-ok">Required</span> Readiness green, lane-separated metrics, corpus fit, and monitoring acceptance before pilot start.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Live status snapshot</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small">Health API status</p>
          <p id="health-status" class="mono">loading...</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Join the waitlist</h2>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://app.jema-ai.com/enterprise/apply">Apply for controlled beta</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:contact@a-codeai.com?subject=%5BCompany%5D%20compression%20scoped%20pilot%20inquiry">Email us</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/">Back to home</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="ecosystem">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>MKM ecosystem connection</h2>
        <div class="ecosystem-grid">
          <article class="ecosystem-item">
            <a href="https://jema-ai.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">jema-ai.com</a>
            <p>Brand and enterprise hub for partner entry and product routing.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ecosystem-item">
            <a href="https://mkmlife.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mkmlife.com</a>
            <p>Consumer one-question report funnel and wellness-oriented UX.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ecosystem-item">
            <a href="https://jemaai.cloud/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">jemaai.cloud</a>
            <p>Public observation board only, non-trading and non-advisory surface.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="notice"><span class="pill pill-warn">Legal</span>A-CODEAI provides B2B token compression evaluation. Measured gains are conditional and lane-separated; not investment advisory or a global performance SLA.</div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p>주식회사 목소리네트워크 · 사업자등록번호 628-86-01742 · <a href="mailto:contact@a-codeai.com">contact@a-codeai.com</a></p>
      <p><a href="https://jema-ai.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy policy</a> · <a href="/legal">Legal</a> · <a href="/">Home</a></p>
      <p>© 2026 주식회사 목소리네트워크.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    (async function () {
      var el = document.getElementById("health-status");
      if (!el) return;
      try {
        var res = await fetch("/health", { cache: "no-store" });
        var data = await res.json();
        var ts = new Date().toISOString();
        el.textContent = "status=" + (data.status || "unknown") + " (checked " + ts + ")";
      } catch (e) {
        el.textContent = "status=unavailable";
      }
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
